// The army is out and the guard answers a raid (WP9.2a, docs/rules/ai.md "Groups"): the AI of `ai_raid` with the profile of
// WP9.2a (`ai_raid_guard_defs/normal.ron`: the shipped numbers, the attack at 800 value from tick 100) on the first match's map,
// with twelve riflemen standing at its gather cell, a power plant and no money, against a lone static construction centre. The
// strike (nine riflemen, the guard of three held back, highest ids first) leaves at once for the staging cell and the enemy
// centre; at tick 1501 the script puts two riflemen of player 1 west of the AI's base and orders them to attack the power plant
// (slot 1). The units at home must kill them while the strike is still out; the strike is not called back (only a hit on the
// construction centre does that). The run ends at 3000.
//
// `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy (ai_raid_guard_defs, made for WP9.2a): the shipped definitions of 13-11-2026, the profile
// above and a match file of its own. The ore, harvest, storage, money, production, power and vision numbers are those of `ai_raid`.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_raid_guard",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_raid_guard_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 3000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 1500, player: 1, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 1, cell: (4, 64))),
        (tick: 1500, player: 1, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 12, owner: 1, cell: (4, 66))),
        (tick: 1501, player: 1, command: OrderAttack(ids: [Id(16, 0), Id(17, 0)], target: (1, 0))),
    ],
)
